    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13902" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποσῡκ-άζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>gather figs,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Amips.
				33
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>squeeze figs,</i> to try whether they are ripe: metaph. of
			informers, with a play on <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συκοφαντία,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				259
			</span></i>.</div>
